Unresolved reference fallback folds soft breaks on plain and ANSI

```
[a
b][missing]
.
<p>[a
b][missing]</p>
```

```
::: \
[a
b][missing]
:::
.
<div class="hardbreaks">
  <p>[a
b][missing]</p>
</div>
```

```
::: \
![a
b][missing]
:::
.
<div class="hardbreaks">
  <p>![a
b][missing]</p>
</div>
```

```
[a\
b][missing]
.
<p>[a\
b][missing]</p>
```
